              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu kwezi kw’indwi, ku musi wakwo wa mirongwibiri na rimwe, ijambo ry’Uhoraho ryavugiye muri Hagayi uwavugishwa na we, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "rit’ Enda barira Zerubabeli umwe atwara i Buyuda, mwene Sheyalitiyeli, na Yosuwa umuherezi mukuru, mwene Yehozadaki, n’amasigarira y’iri hanga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZR.3.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezr 3:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEC.4.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zek 4:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uti Mbega ni nde agisigaye muri mwebge yoba yarabonye ubgiza iyi ngoro yahoranye ubga mbere? Ubu ho muyibona mute? Ubu si nk’ubusa mu maso yanyu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEC.8.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zek 8:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yamara noneho rema, ewe Zerubabeli, ni k’Uhoraho agize; nawe nyene rema, ewe Yosuwa umuherezi mukuru, mwene Yehozadaki; kandi namwe bantu bo mu gihugu mwese, ni mureme, ni k’Uhoraho agize, kandi mushireko mukore, kuko ndi kumwe namwe, ni k’Uhoraho Nyen’ ingabo agize, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:5"
          },
